# corvusgcs
===
 Offline-first ground control station for PX4 and ArduPilot autonomous aircraft. Live map, floating flight HUD, guided sensor calibration, motor and safety setup, parameter editing and built-in flight-log review. One self-contained desktop app for Windows, macOS and Linux, no internet required.
